{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L4HKj8o3oPFTcqY4Tr63xg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# diff_collision_sdf — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-25 22:31 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 通过, 进入 Research 阶段, D023 修正叙事, post-MVP kickoff Steps 1-4 完成\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-26 ~06:00 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 通过 (D023), 进入 Research 阶段, \\\\\\\"30K collapse\\\\\\\" 叙事被推翻\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA safety 评估方法论缺陷：CAR 被 action collapse / geometric path safety 污染，98%+ 的表面安全是假象。提出 EE displacement-filtered CAR + SDF auxiliary loss 作为验证工具。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-26 通过）\\\\n- **目标**: CoRL 2026 Main / ICRA 2027\\\\n- **核心发现**: SDF 产生真实碰撞避免（EE ~0.5m, 0% fake, +25pp CAR），但 tradeoff 极端（TSR -65pp）。效果跨步数稳定（D023 推翻 \\\\\\\"30K collapse\\\\\\\"）\\\\n- **Claims**: 1★★★★★ 2★★★ 3★★★★ 4★★★★ — Claim 4 强度待 LoRA baseline 归因\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260525T223036 pending (full review mode)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] MVP 通过 (complete_mvp)\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md 更新 (D023 修正)\\\\n- [x] experiment_plan.yaml 创建 (11 experiments, P0×6 + P1×5)\\\\n- [x] dream_simulate 启动\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 按指令处理\\\\n- [ ] LoRA baseline 完成 (ETA ~09:30 UTC) → eval → Claim 4 归因决定\\\\n- [ ] Phase 2 λ=0 完成 → eval → 是否升级 solution paper\\\\n- [ ] A1 EE disp re-eval → Claim 1 术语验证\\\\n- [ ] OpenVLA eval → Claim 1 跨模型泛化\\\\n- [ ] spatial_bowl 训练完成 (~24h) → eval → Claim 4 跨场景\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 分配\\\\n| 服务器 | GPU | 实验 | ETA |\\\\n|--------|-----|------|-----|\\\\n| westd-35807 | 0 | spatial_bowl 训练 (38%) | ~May 27 06:00 |\\\\n| westd-35807 | 1 | A1 EE disp re-eval | ~45min (启动中) |\\\\n| westd-35807 | 2 | OpenVLA / lambda 实验 | TBD |\\\\n| westd-35807 | 3 | Phase 2 λ=0 seed2 训练 | ~20h |\\\\n| westd-45947 | 0 | LoRA baseline s0 (step 26K/30K) | ~09:30 UTC |\\\\n| westd-45947 | 1 | LoRA baseline s1 (step 26K/30K) | ~09:30 UTC |\\\\n\\\\n**利用率**: 5-6/6（GPU 1/2 有短期任务或待分配）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键时间线\\\\n| 时间 | 事件 | 行动 |\\\\n|------|------|------|\\\\n| +45min | A1 re-eval 完成 | 确认 Claim 1 EE disp |\\\\n| +3-4h | LoRA baseline 完成 | 立即 eval, 决定 Claim 4 归因 |\\\\n| +20h | Phase 2 λ=0 完成 | eval, 判断是否升级 paper |\\\\n| +24h | spatial_bowl 完成 | eval 跨场景泛化 |\\\\n| Dream 回调 | dream 完成 | 审查 framing/plan 调整 |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: 6 GPU (westd-35807 × 4 + westd-45947 × 2)\\\\n- P0 实验剩余 GPU-hours: ~60h (LoRA eval 20h + Phase 2 eval 10h + OpenVLA 5h + etc)\\\\n- P1 实验 GPU-hours: ~98h (spatial eval + lambda=0.1 + full A1 re-eval)\\\\n- 按 6 GPU 计, P0+P1 全部完成需 ~3 天\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-25 | D023: \\\\\\\"30K action collapse\\\\\\\"叙事被修正数据彻底推翻——30K EE dis | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4, eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k, eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-25 | D022: 暂停\\\\\\\"30K = action collapse / 100% frozen\\\\\\\"叙事——旧 | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4, eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k, eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-25 | D021: Displacement 度量修复方案——用 EE displacement 替代 ob | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01 |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-25 | D020: 30K TSR退化揭示safety-performance tradeoff——10K是 | eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005, eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01 |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-25 | D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B ( | a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0, oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-24 | D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action co | oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11, oracle_true_gt_feature_v11, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-24 | D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧， | train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-23 | D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FA | train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-23 | D015: Step 10K mid-eval 结果——CAR +49pp 强 positive 但 | train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005, train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-23 | D014: 用户明确要求目标主会（CoRL main / ICRA），不是 workshop。纯 n | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3900, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0194HGtGfnwzoV7Zk1AQYGPU","session_id":"f420d955-7ae5-4224-93b3-f4bdf2a953a4","uuid":"14347f41-544a-47cb-8e2d-3d836791097c","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:04:53.848Z"}
